
 OVRCR · startup                                                                

  Connect agent status
  Lets OVRCR show when your Claude and Codex sessions are working, need you or are done.
  Adds or updates OVRCR hooks in:
    /Users/xlyk/.claude/settings.json
    /Users/xlyk/.codex/config.toml
  Your other settings, status line and approvals stay as they are.
  Codex asks you to trust the new hooks the next time it starts.

  [y] Connect  [n] Not now  > n
